# Not committed, matching every other fuzz sub-crate: scripts/ci-check.sh
# passes `--locked` only where a lockfile is tracked, and a fuzz build
# regenerates this. Listed explicitly because a *service* crate tracks its
# own Cargo.lock, so unlike the matcher crates the parent .gitignore does
# not cover this one.
Cargo.lock
